flowchart LR
  U([User gives a task]):::ext --> T[Triage: Tier line heads scope.md, critical path]:::main
  AI([User writes /ai on GitHub]):::ext --> T
  W([Watcher event in events.log]):::ext --> MON[Monitor wakes the session]:::main
  EXP([Monitor expired]):::ext --> REARM[Re-arm it at once]:::main
  MON --> K{Kind}:::main
  K -->|comment or review| C[[Comment flow]]:::main
  K -->|CI red, conflict| CI[[Event flows]]:::main
  K -->|merge, release, DEPENDENT| CI
  K -->|maintainer commits, thumbs| CI
  K -->|REFACTOR or TRACKER STALE| CI
  T -->|Tier 0| A0[[Answer]]:::main
  T -->|Tier S| S[[PR pipeline S]]:::main
  T -->|Tier M| M[[PR pipeline M]]:::main
  T -->|Tier L| L[[Program L]]:::main
  P([About to write to GitHub]):::ext --> G[[Posting gate]]:::gate
  R([Session resumes]):::ext --> RS[events.log past events.cursor, replies-owed.md, scope.md Tier line, ledger: passes owed]:::main
  RS --> K
  RS -->|a pass is owed| M
